# Cross-turn KV PREFIX REUSE for the Core AI language engines.
#
# Adds a KV-rewind primitive so a chat loop can keep the cache for the shared
# conversation prefix and prefill only the new tokens, instead of re-prefilling
# the whole history every turn (CoreAIChatMac multi-turn TTFT 23.3s -> 0.23s at
# 4k ctx, lossless). See knowledge/prefix-cache-kv-reuse.md.
#
#   InferenceEngine: trimKVCache(to:) -> Int  (retained prefix, <0 = unsupported)
#                    prefixReuseFeedsFullSequence  (feed contract)
#   Sequential + Pipelined: rewind processedTokenCount (pure-attention only;
#                    recurrent/SSM returns <0 -> caller resets + full re-prefill).
#
# Apply on top of the coreai-pipelined-* patch stack against apple/coreai-models.
#
